[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="Conversation" format=3]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://game/talk/conversation.gd" id="1_convo"]

[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_convo")
id = &"n3_thomas"
text = "# DRAFT
# Thomas at dusk, in the infirmary (night 3). Tall, thin, stooped, gentle deep-set eyes, fingers stained from his herbs; he hums at his mortar.
# Your first ally. He tells you what he has noticed, always about someone else. (He leads the cult. Nothing here says so.)
# At supper Ranulf offers his remedy and Thomas warns you off it; the headaches answer sets that up.
== start
(Thomas is at his bench, grinding something in a mortar and humming. He stops when he sees you, and smiles.)
Thomas: Alric. Come in. You slept, I hope? You've the look of a man who dreamed.
-> topics

== again
(Thomas looks up from his mortar. His fingers are stained green to the knuckle.)
Thomas: Back again? Sit. I'm only grinding.
-> topics

== topics
* [if not n3_thomas_headaches] My head aches, Brother Thomas. It won't let up. -> headaches
* [if not n3_thomas_anselm] How is Brother Anselm? -> anselm
* [if not n3_thomas_tower] Did you know the brother in the bell tower? -> tower

== headaches [set n3_thomas_headaches]
Thomas: Behind the eyes? Worse when you wake?
(He tilts your face to the window and looks into one eye, then the other.)
Thomas: It's the night hours. A body takes a month to learn them. Sleep with your shutter closed, and eat.
Thomas: And if anyone offers you physic for it, come to me first. Physic is my trade.
-> topics

== anselm [set n3_thomas_anselm]
Thomas: Quieter since the tower. He asks after you. Old porters never stop keeping the gate.
Thomas: Don't let him frighten you, Alric. His mind wanders at night. He hears things.
-> topics

== tower [set n3_thomas_tower]
Thomas: Bede. I'm sorry you were the one who found him. A hard thing, on your second night.
Thomas: Father Abbot says the demon. I've seen what I've seen in this house. I don't argue with him.
Thomas: Only I wonder about the prior. He was up the tower stair before any of us. Quick, for a man woken by a bell.
-> topics

== leave
Thomas: Rest before supper, Alric. The nights are long.
"
